{
  "id": "ch03_s24_shuge",
  "chapter": 3,
  "act": 3,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "给三种身份各递来下一件事，留给第四章实际作答",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "翌日，唐将小账与原卷分放。你买的纸已有收据，新递来的东西压在砚边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l2",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日送来的，还没有写进已办那一栏。你可以先看，也可以留下时辰再答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l3",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "哪一份找我？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "有人反对你处置候选差务的旧例，问新署仍由近人经手，会不会换名不换人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是礼成以后递的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是。具名来的，还有两份同议。不在授位旧卷里，要由今日在位的人答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你揭开封面，第一行顶着新称谓。纸的背面还空着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "把同议也放来。先读，不替我添批。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（昨天才把我的名字念完。今天已经有人在下面写，不妥。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "辞受与重推另存。给你的这一张，是往后寄东西到哪儿，只留了空行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一定得今日填？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不用。住处未改，就还照现在投递；没有新职，也不是这张漏了一项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你将纸摊到亮处。空行够写很长一串字，笔尖没有落下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先留着。我今日想晚一点再出门。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "下一次公议问扩办款，你的提案仍列着。去不去听，可以先答，领不领差另说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的反对也能当面念？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能。主持那位已经签了受理，时辰在末行。带哪几页，由你自己挑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你将邀请牒折到时辰那一行，放在自己的提案上。纸角没有再硌着掌心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我先看。不替我答应新的差。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l20",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐将砚盖揭开，墨面上浮着一丝窗光。门外有人走过，没有进来催。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l21",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这一回先不写已经办成。你把原件放这里，我看完以后，亲手落下一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l22",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    }
  ],
  "chapterEnd": true,
  "goto": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang"
}
